{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】審計署署長今日(11月25日)發表第87號報告書衡工量值式審計結果。另外，香港中華總商會舉行會董就職典禮，行政長官李家超、中聯辦主任周霽、外交部駐港特派員崔建春出席。</p><p>採訪日誌｜審計署發表審計報告／中華總商會會董就職典禮</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.829548+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:48.306991+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:48.306991+00:00","content_hash":"f5b03531aefc0cb62d24dc5ca0be8e13b45d97fbedfe805f468eaf0290d595fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}